00:33:28.740 --> 00:33:30.140
They ruined it. They ruined it.

00:33:30.220 --> 00:33:31.660
And continue with their time.

00:33:31.840 --> 00:33:32.920
I understand. I understand.

00:33:32.920 --> 00:33:38.920
I understand, I understand, but still, I don't think there is an expression in Arabic, Nizam al-Ayni

00:33:38.920 --> 00:33:43.920
I cannot look at this person, he is Nizam al-Ayni, I cannot respect him. I have no respect.

00:33:43.920 --> 00:33:51.920
The Abadeel said, I am Nizam al-Ayni, I have no, zero respect. I respect Arafat much more.

00:33:51.920 --> 00:33:54.920
Why? He has come up for his own people.

00:33:54.920 --> 00:34:00.920
Listen, you know, if he resigns, just tell him the peace process.

00:34:00.920 --> 00:34:08.820
Sharon said, you know, I read in the Israeli newspaper, he says today, if Rabin, if we go for election, Rabin wins.

00:34:09.700 --> 00:34:14.860
Believe it or not, I mean, if Sharon says it, he knows what he's talking about.

00:34:14.860 --> 00:34:18.940
So for them, going to election is not the solution right now.

00:34:18.980 --> 00:34:21.620
Because Sharon says, give them six months to a year.

00:34:21.720 --> 00:34:22.860
They're still killing.

