they will have bought together

00:35:28.040 --> 00:35:35.040
No, there's one of them that is not a crook. Abraham. Abraham or Yaakov. Yaakov is very, very nice.

00:35:35.040 --> 00:35:40.040
Rabbi, there's one, his oldest son I heard, I don't know if it's true. He said that if you could, he would kill you.

00:35:40.040 --> 00:35:43.040
I don't know. I know. Yaakov, Yaakov is very nice.

