Then they said that they saw this news story because they wanted to take him to court.

00:35:47.040 --> 00:35:52.040
Yaakov, he doesn't like it. I know Yaakov. I met him. He used to be my friend many years ago.

00:35:52.040 --> 00:35:56.040
and he studied Kabbalah, you know, there they are.

00:35:56.040 --> 00:35:58.040
Anyhow, it's a crazy world.

