Herr Schmidt.

00:43:15.960 --> 00:43:17.300
Herr Lefort Schmidt.

00:43:18.300 --> 00:43:19.060
Same thing.

00:43:19.880 --> 00:43:20.040
What?

00:43:22.440 --> 00:43:24.200
All of them are the same thing.

00:43:24.560 --> 00:43:26.340
And that's why, from the point of view of Judaism,

00:43:26.880 --> 00:43:29.620
when you go and fight against a nation,

00:43:29.620 --> 00:43:39.620
Taq van Hashim. Everybody is responsible. There is absolutely no difference for us between the

00:43:39.620 --> 00:43:48.620
mayor of Berlin and the doorman of an apartment in Berlin. Same thing. All of them, they are the same.

00:43:48.620 --> 00:43:51.620
The belief is irrevocable.

00:43:51.620 --> 00:43:53.620
Which belief?

00:43:53.620 --> 00:43:55.620
The belief between Hashim and Bnei Israel.

00:43:55.620 --> 00:44:02.620
Absolutely. But he is going to destroy the Galut. We are the children of them.

