But I think he gave them Bet HaMikdash. It's like, you know, when you invade a state, what do you do?

00:44:18.620 --> 00:44:22.620
When do you actually retain the state? When you conquer the capital.

00:44:22.620 --> 00:44:28.520
The capital is Bethlehem. Judah is the capital. So therefore he gave them

