That was right after Yerushalem. And the participant, the Jew was Yosef Nassim, one of the greatest Jews of the start. And the Christian, of course, the Jews and so on. Then the Jews, the Muslim and the Jews and the Christian say to the Jew, well, you're so great. How come you don't have the Bida Mikdash?

01:07:00.060 --> 01:07:08.060
