He's actually admitting.

01:07:25.060 --> 01:07:28.060
for Biossef Nasek

01:07:28.060 --> 01:07:31.060
we don't know how to respect it

01:07:31.060 --> 01:07:34.060
the Ba'al says you Muslims you respect the place

01:07:34.060 --> 01:07:37.060
we don't know how to respect it

