01:08:48.940 --> 01:08:49.700
Why do they say,

01:08:49.700 --> 01:08:58.700
And he came to pass at the end of 20 years, because it took him 20 years to build these things.

01:08:58.700 --> 01:09:06.700
And then arrived the king. Then he saw the king's wife and children in the land of the Arabs and the land of the Bedouins and in the gold of all the treasures.

