Do you remember the king of Lebanon was sending continuously to King Solomon

01:09:17.700 --> 01:09:42.000
the pine trees, the cedars, the oak trees, and gold as much as King Solomon wanted. Now, I don't know if you remember, in payment, he had to give him food. Do you remember? Food? I don't know if you remember. Wheat and so on.

01:09:42.000 --> 01:09:43.780
But you remember that was a deal.

01:09:44.020 --> 01:09:45.080
Yeah, a bar turning there.

01:09:45.940 --> 01:09:48.020
So now, Shimon Melech,

01:09:49.020 --> 01:09:50.940
he says, why should I give you this thing?

01:09:51.520 --> 01:09:52.360
Now, he's saying that?

01:09:52.380 --> 01:09:52.540
Yeah.

01:09:53.060 --> 01:09:53.600
