01:10:07.360 --> 01:10:10.060
to work on these 20 towns.

01:10:10.960 --> 01:10:11.820
And all the food,

01:10:12.000 --> 01:10:22.000
that you want, you get it from these towns. Yes, by your border. Alright? And by the border,

01:10:22.000 --> 01:10:32.000
the 20 towns you planted and so on, you take the food, all the food from these towns,

01:10:32.000 --> 01:10:39.000
automatically to you. Instead of me giving you the food, you have your own workers, just like I have my workers

01:10:39.000 --> 01:10:42.000
in your town, in your, I'm sorry, in your land.

01:10:42.660 --> 01:10:45.840
You bring your workers there

01:10:45.840 --> 01:10:48.440
and whatever you produce, that is yours.

01:10:48.880 --> 01:10:49.220
All right?

01:10:49.740 --> 01:10:52.300
Yeah, and he's going to rent out the land.

01:10:52.820 --> 01:10:53.300
No.

01:10:53.700 --> 01:10:54.420
The lease, right.

01:10:54.600 --> 01:10:55.460
