The Samis carried him as much as he could take.

01:11:10.660 --> 01:11:12.660
So he made good deals.

01:11:12.660 --> 01:11:14.660
Now...

01:11:14.660 --> 01:11:16.660
Cost him zero.

01:11:18.660 --> 01:11:26.660
Alright, Aziz al-Iman, Shulamon al-Iram, he came to the king of Iran,

01:11:26.660 --> 01:11:33.660
and sent here 20 cities for planting the El Zaghalir in the north.

01:11:33.660 --> 01:11:39.660
Now this guy has to plant. Those guys in Syria, they don't know how to plant.

