An arid land.

01:12:12.360 --> 01:12:14.160
Adayom hazeh.

01:12:14.160 --> 01:12:21.260
Now, so then, he wanted to get the wheat.

01:12:21.260 --> 01:12:26.160
Shaykh Muhammad will not give him the wheat.

01:12:26.160 --> 01:12:32.640
He said, I gave you the twenty cities. You should have planted.

