Now, why Shino Mo wanted this?

01:13:39.360 --> 01:13:47.360
the guy no more has gold. I understand. Why did Hiram send Shlomo gold? Because he wants the food.

01:13:47.360 --> 01:13:54.360
Oh, Shlomo didn't want it, so he didn't... That was the end of the 20 years. I don't need no more of your

