Anything you produce is yours.

01:21:29.260 --> 01:21:35.260
He said, get the food through his face, he doesn't want to take it.

01:21:35.260 --> 01:21:45.260
The easiest way for a country to make money is to just rip off all the resources.

01:21:45.260 --> 01:21:51.260
You know what makes America such an extraordinary country? Powerful country?

01:21:51.260 --> 01:21:57.260
It's the agriculture. America controls the world because of its food.

01:21:57.260 --> 01:21:59.260
Green.

01:21:59.260 --> 01:22:04.260
You know, soybeans feeding Asia, planted in America.

01:22:04.260 --> 01:22:06.260
Rice, planted in America.

01:22:06.260 --> 01:22:11.260
Cow, I don't know, meat, this, planted in America.

01:22:11.260 --> 01:22:14.260
They control the food of the world.

01:22:14.260 --> 01:22:18.260
But what about wheat?

01:22:18.260 --> 01:22:19.260
What?

01:22:19.260 --> 01:22:41.820
I hope I'll do it in my field.

01:22:41.820 --> 01:22:42.820
The Rangers won.

01:22:42.820 --> 01:22:43.820
The Rangers are gone?

01:22:43.820 --> 01:22:44.820
Rangers?

01:22:44.820 --> 01:22:45.820
Rangers.

01:22:45.820 --> 01:22:49.160
Alright, so that's it.

01:22:49.580 --> 01:22:54.440
So, you take me, I have to have a word with you about something else.

01:22:54.820 --> 01:22:54.980
Alright?

01:22:56.660 --> 01:22:58.700
Ha-ham, David, we'll see you Sunday in class.

01:22:58.700 --> 01:22:59.860
Ha-ham.

01:22:59.860 --> 01:23:00.160
Ha-ham.

01:23:00.160 --> 01:23:01.260
Ha-ham.

01:23:01.260 --> 01:23:01.600
Ha-ham.

01:23:01.600 --> 01:23:01.840
Ha-ham.

01:23:01.840 --> 01:23:01.940
Ha-ham.

01:23:01.940 --> 01:23:02.040
Ha-ham.

01:23:02.040 --> 01:23:02.540
Ha-ham.

01:23:02.540 --> 01:23:02.600
Ha-ham.

01:23:02.600 --> 01:23:03.000
Ha-ham.

01:23:03.000 --> 01:23:03.440
Ha-ham.

01:23:03.440 --> 01:23:03.560
Ha-ham.

01:23:03.560 --> 01:23:03.860
Ha-ham.

